d tool reads; Evidence headers show selected ranges, whose delivery requires HTTP confirmation.\",\"reading_after_write\":\"First-write prerequisites satisfied; changed-source evidence may be invalidated.\",\"required_mechanisms_exposed\":{\"deepinfer/engine/stats_logger.py\":{\"exposed\":4,\"registered\":4},\"deepinfer/environ.py\":{\"exposed\":0,\"registered\":0},\"deepinfer/logger.py\":{\"exposed\":3,\"registered\":3}}}"}], "tool_calls": null, "raw": null, "token_usage": null}, {"role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "All three mechanisms are exposed (EnvVar descriptor + rearm functions, NewLineFormatter + _setup_logger, and the queue consumer `_log_worker`). Applying the environ.py edit first.\n\n```python\nr = replace_text(\n    \"deepinfer/environ.py\",\n    '''def _str(v: str | None, default: str = \"\") -> str:\n    return v if v is not None else default\n''',\n    '''def _str(v: str | None, default: str = \"\") -> str:\n    return v if v is not None else default\n\n\ndef _int_or_none_min(v: str | None, minimum: int = 32) -> int | None:\n    \"\"\"Parse an optional int; unset means no limit, otherwise must be >= minimum.\"\"\"\n    if v is None:\n        return None\n    value = int(v)\n    if value < minimum:\n        raise ValueError(f\"{v!r} must be >= {minimum}\")\n    return value\n''',\n    'fe2c531989c419f0b51b169a07f5ed826dcec7f95c0c5bc3a351805923c4f218',\n)\nprint(r)\n```"}], "tool_calls": null, "raw": null, "token_usage": null}, {"role": "user", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Latest execution feedback:\nExecutor output:\nExecution logs:\n{'path': 'deepinfer/environ.py', 'file_hash': 'fe5ebb5fe3a1b2f9acbdf34cd89e6e777a95ff3fb711121fbef23d00a6b43a30', 'before_hash': 'fe2c531989c419f0b51b169a07f5ed826dcec7f95c0c5bc3a351805923c4f218', 'changed': True}\nLast output from code snippet:\nNone\nRecent project tool results:\n[{\"tool\":\"read_range\",\"arguments\":{\"start_line\":95,\"end_line\":235},\"result\":{\"path\":\"deepinfer